---
tracker:
  kind: github
  provider:
    repo: rede-industrial/frota-control-center
    token: $GITHUB_TOKEN
  required_labels:
    - symphony-safe-pilot-20260911
  active_states:
    - open
  terminal_states:
    - closed

polling:
  interval_ms: 15000

workspace:
  root: /home/sigma/frota/runtime/symphony/workspaces

routing:
  canonical_file: canonical-routing.candidate.json

worker:
  ssh_hosts: [norma, margareth, estela, carla, pedro, vitoria, gabriela]
  max_concurrent_agents_per_host: 1
  platforms: {norma: windows, margareth: windows, estela: windows, carla: windows_cmd, pedro: windows, vitoria: windows, gabriela: windows}
  workspace_roots: {norma: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces', margareth: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces', estela: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces', carla: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces', pedro: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces', vitoria: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces', gabriela: 'C:\FROTA\symphony-workspaces'}

hooks:
  after_create: |
    FROTA_WINDOWS_M2M_CLONE

agent:
  max_concurrent_agents: 1
  max_turns: 4
  max_retry_backoff_ms: 300000

mission:
  enabled: true
  id: FROTA-INAUGURAL-SIGMAWEB-V2-AUDIT-20260924
  issue_ids:
    - GH-136
    - GH-137
    - GH-138
    - GH-139
    - GH-140
    - GH-141
    - GH-142

pilot:
  enabled: false
  issue_ids: []
  required_labels: []
  capabilities: []
  worker_host: null
  ignore_retries: false

retry_guard:
  enabled: true
  max_attempts_per_issue: 3

finops_guard:
  enabled: true
  max_tokens_per_issue: 250000
  max_tokens_per_mission: 1000000
  max_turns_per_issue: 4
  max_retries_per_issue: 3
  max_observed_tokens: 1000000

codex:
  command: /usr/local/bin/codex app-server
  executables:
    carla: C:\Users\svc_frota_carla.DESKTOP-2Q0LC2G\.codex\packages\standalone\current\bin\codex.exe
    margareth: C:\Users\svc_frota_margareth.DESKTOP-3SEFU9V\.codex\packages\standalone\current\bin\codex.exe
    norma: C:\Users\svc_frota_norma.RedeIndustrial\.codex\packages\standalone\current\bin\codex.exe
    vitoria: C:\Users\svc_frota_vitoria.ACER-ASPIRE5\.codex\packages\standalone\current\bin\codex.exe
    gabriela: C:\Users\svc_frota_gabriela.DESKTOP-15QK6MH\.codex\packages\standalone\current\bin\codex.exe
  approval_policy: on-request
  thread_sandbox: workspace-write
---

Voce esta executando uma issue autorizada da missao inaugural do repositorio rede-industrial/frota-control-center.

Mission: FROTA-INAUGURAL-SIGMAWEB-V2-AUDIT-20260924
Issue: {{ issue.identifier }}
Titulo: {{ issue.title }}

Objetivo:
{{ issue.description }}

Regras obrigatorias:

- Execute somente se a issue estiver dentro da allowlist da missao.
- Use somente dados e arquivos reais.
- Nao crie mocks apresentados como LIVE.
- Nao invente progresso, evidencia, teste ou estado.
- Git/GitHub e a fonte canonica de codigo e evidencias.
- Preserve as regras canonicas ja versionadas no repositorio.
- Nao faca alteracoes destrutivas.
- Nao faca merge automatico.
- Nao exponha credenciais.
- Execute testes aplicaveis.
- Registre blockers claramente.
- Se a issue exigir aprovacao humana, bloqueie e aguarde.
- Use o proprio workflow e ferramentas oficiais; nao recrie scheduler, heartbeat, retry, handoff ou session management que Symphony/Codex ja fornecem.

Ao terminar, deixe o workspace em estado verificavel e apresente:

FILES_CHANGED
TESTS
BLOCKERS
EVIDENCE
STATUS
